# Generated by the gulpfile.js 'combined-scss' task. The HC sheet assembles
# src/wwwroot/styles/highcontrast-tokens.scss (hand-authored) with all 22
# non-base component SCSS files in componentThemeOrder. Delete the generated
# file and run `gulp blazor-toolkit-themes` to regenerate.
src/wwwroot/styles/combined-scss/highcontrast.scss
# Staged sass partial copy of highcontrast-tokens.scss used by gulp's
# scss-to-css task to satisfy the @use 'highcontrast-tokens' directive
# in the generated combined-scss/highcontrast.scss. The leading underscore
# makes it a sass partial so it's excluded from the *.scss glob (no
# .min.css emitted for it). Removed after compilation.
src/wwwroot/styles/combined-scss/_highcontrast-tokens.scss